		(at 5.5 24.46)
		(descr "Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V4 (HTIT-WB32LAF), ESP32-S3R2 + SX1262 with 28dBm FEM, GNSS & solar connectors, 2x18 2.54mm headers + 2x2 pads at antenna end. GPIO2/7/46 drive the LoRa FEM and GPIO34/38-42 the GNSS connector on-board - avoid if those are used. GPIO0/3/45/46 are ESP32-S3 strapping pins. Mount OLED side up; pad 1 = J2-1 at the USB end, pads 19-36 = J3-1..18. https://resource.heltec.cn/download/WiFi_LoRa_32_V4/datasheet/WiFi_LoRa_32_V4.2.0.pdf")
